The zugeo package bundles the geoarrow-c library and the Apache Arrow
nanoarrow core it ships with. zugeo is distributed under the MIT license.
geoarrow-c and nanoarrow are distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The licences apply to their respective
files; the package as a whole is not MIT-licensed. inst/COPYRIGHTS lists
each directory and its notice.
